  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "org.fcrepo.server.validation.DOValidatorImpl has a FIXME dating back to the days of Sandy Payette (who appears to have written the code):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "// FIXME We need to use the object Inputstream twice, once for XML",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Schema validation and once for Schematron validation.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "// We may want to consider implementing some form of a rewindable",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "// InputStream. For now, I will just write the object InputStream to",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "// disk so I can read it multiple times.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Seems like now is as good a time as any to FIXME. {grin}",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
