  "description": "<p>org.fcrepo.server.validation.DOValidatorImpl has a FIXME dating back to the days of Sandy Payette (who appears to have written the code):</p>\n\n<p>        // FIXME We need to use the object Inputstream twice, once for XML<br/>\n        // Schema validation and once for Schematron validation.<br/>\n        // We may want to consider implementing some form of a rewindable<br/>\n        // InputStream. For now, I will just write the object InputStream to<br/>\n        // disk so I can read it multiple times.</p>\n\n<p> Seems like now is as good a time as any to FIXME. </p>\n{grin}\n",
